<title>USA: Gulfstream to double aircraft production.</title>
<headline>Gulfstream to double aircraft production.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulfstream Aerospace Corp said Tuesday it will double its aircraft production by 1999 because of strong demand.</p>
<p>The company said it will raise the number of aircraft produced to 60 in 1999, twice the 1996 level.</p>
<p>The company cited strong demand for the Gulfstream IV-SP and the new, ultra-long range Gulfstream V business jets, which it said have an estimated $3.5 billion backlog.</p>
<p>Gulfstream completed a $1.02 billion initial public offering on October 17.</p>
<p>Gulfstream shares gained 1-1/8 Tuesday to 24-1/4.</p>
